{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB台慶劇《璀璨之城》自播出後話題不斷，除了大尺度裸露、情慾、出浴戲碼及暴力場面外，亦有「女女戀」的畫面。</p><p>劇中陳瀅暗戀陳曉華，昨日（2日）播出的一集更上演陳瀅主動親吻陳曉華的畫面，搶盡觀眾眼球。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:37.431783+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:34:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.045737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.045737+00:00","content_hash":"89e1c7ec868871928f55d3c4628df90e2360ee8ad7975115ff3fbda05a931ad2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}